  "qualitative": [
    "Kinetic typography carries the edit: big headline words with one keyword in an accent colour or a contrasting serif/script face",
    "Speakers framed mid-chest, centred, often cut out over a dark or clean-white graphic background",
    "Visual nouns get a graphic: phone/UI mock-ups, logos, numbers ('No. 3') appear as the word is said",
    "High contrast looks: near-black or near-white backgrounds, saturated accent colour; skin kept natural",
    "Hard cuts dominate; dissolves and whips are used inside motion-graphics sequences, rarely between speaker shots"
  ],
  "platform": "shorts",
  "caveats": [
